{"title":"Real Photos That Look Fake","link":"https://kottke.org/25/10/real-photos-that-look-fake","date":1760696126000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/real-fakes-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/real-fakes-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/real-fakes-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1625\" alt=\"trees, road, sky, and water all meet perfectly in the center of this impossibly geometric photo\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/real-fakes-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/real-fakes-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/real-fakes-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"960\" height=\"1199\" alt=\"two guys standing on a front loader raised in the air; it looks like they are giants compared to all around them\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/real-fakes-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/real-fakes-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/real-fakes-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1734\" alt=\"a bank of clouds over the road looks like a rising ocean tide\" /></p>\n\n<p>I’ve seen <a href=\"https://www.boredpanda.com/confusing-not-photoshopped-photos/\">a bunch of these</a> before, but it’s cool to scroll and get your tiny mind blown over and over again. Human cognition and perception is such a trip. (via <a href=\"https://www.neatorama.com/2025/10/15/Confusing-Optical-Illusions-Caught-in-Photographs/\">neatorama</a>)</p